      "writtenOn": "2022-12-29T21:08:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Mikhail, there are multiple test suites. There are common parameters across test suites. Labelling each param of test suite with a unique enum label is confusing and is repetitive. I have ensured the variables are named properly. Is this sufficient? Do you want me to go ahead and upload the enum change as well.",
